{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/254609-hunter-net-still-around","id":254609,"title":"Hunter-net, still around?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-09-11T14:15:28-07:00","id":254609,"title":"Hunter-net, still around?","content":"Once upon a time I ran a Hunter game and used the hunter-net mailing list (the one with real posts from players, not just the posts from the various books) as a backdrop to the world. It worked out really well and added a layer of depth to the game. I'm getting ready to run another one now and am wanting to use the list again, but I can't seem to find it. Is it still around, or if it's not is there an archive of it somewhere?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3842-sisk","name":"Sisk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-11T16:12:28-07:00","id":254737,"title":"","content":"No idea. But, I hope you have a kickass time running a HtR game. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I always do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-18T21:34:40-07:00","id":260356,"title":"","content":"God, those days were awesome. I think my heart broke when the whole thing fizzled out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-09T10:55:32-07:00","id":276490,"title":"","content":"If you find it or an archive, let me know. I think hunter has some of the best in-game fiction.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.hunter-net.org/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.hunter-net.org/</a> used to be up with a good amount of mock-fiction, but it seems that site has been suspended now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3854-darthcoffee","name":"darthcoffee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3854_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-06T23:06:05-08:00","id":332777,"title":"","content":"HtR was my favorite cWoD game, since hunter-net is down i really want to, someday, open a multinational forum and several chronicle in several countrys start at the same time and post as hunters, i know is hard but i really love to see that someday. By the way, sorry if my english is not the best.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3159-axlfairus","name":"axlfairus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-07T06:33:11-08:00","id":332928,"title":"","content":"Trust me boy...it Should<br /> <br /> *snif*..It Should...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-15T20:04:58-08:00","id":341481,"title":"","content":"Hunter net was so much fun! It was a like you were playing a giant shared chronicle all over the world. Although when everyone would start arguing in OOC brackets [] about when someone's post revealed &quot;too much&quot; about the Messengers it got silly. But some people had more of the books than others. It never bothered me as my Hunter net persona could always just write the guy off as crazy, but people used to get super butt hurt about it.<br /> <br /> Anyways, Hunter Net was fun and I too miss those days.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>May you live in interesting times...</i><br /> <br /> Storyteller of <b><a href=\"https://sunforgedoath.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Sun Forged Oath</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1998-keichiokami","name":"Keichiokami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1998_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-20T07:32:11-07:00","id":450418,"title":"","content":"Oh, nostalgia... I was in college when hunter-net was going strong and spent far too much time posting instead of school work.<br /> <br /> Anybody remember Crackhead Dick, the Malkavian who somehow found his way onto the list and decided he was going to be Imbued, too?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5420-pleone","name":"pleone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-20T07:39:27-07:00","id":450426,"title":"","content":"Sadly not even the Wayback machine seems to have cought it...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-20T14:33:52-07:00","id":450902,"title":"","content":"I feel like SOMEone must have an old not-yet-erased hard drive from that era lying around, with cached versions of the webpages they visited...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date